window.products.push({"id":926084,"name":"Laebevon Boho Table Runner with Tassels Farmhouse Rustic Splicing Woven Cotton Crochet for Kitchen Dining Living Room Dresser Picnic Wedding Table Dec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NXNjwxnCL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"How to maintain the table runner? (Shipment fold flat, wrinkles exist.) 1. Spray the table runner with a spray bottle filled with water until it is quite damp. 2. Set it flat onto an ironing board and cover the largest wrinkles with a thin towel. 3. Set your iron to its lowest heat setting and allow it several minutes to heat up. 4. Gently press the iron atop the towel to release the table runner's worst wrinkles. 5. Do not rubbing vigorously, Do not wash in the washer, Do not use bleaching agent. Washing Hand wash best, no colors ran after washing, lay flat to dry, don't bleach. For daily use, simply shake off the dust or use a white cloth to blot out mild stains. Thickened Material Our natural table runner is made of thick material, enough to decorate your table and make your home refreshed. Your family and friends will praise it when they see it. Table Decoration This warm and luxurious cotton table runner is the perfect compliment for your rustic or farmhouse holiday table. It will make you in a happy mood when eating, and help improve your dining experience and impress your guests. Add Rustic Atmosphere Adding a lovely lace accent to the rooms in your home with this crochet table runners, easy way to transform your table. It gives a minimalist feel and creating a relaxed feel, wonderful for adding a vintage touch to your home decoration. Bohemian Themed Party Decorations Our natural macrame table runner fits both a bohemian, natural style, as well as that of a rustic farmhouse, perfect for giving your wedding decor a natural, bohemian edge. Warm Tips There is an extra line at the bottom to fix the tassels to avoid it knotted, please remove the line by yourself when you use the table runner.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NXNjwxnCL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laebevon","source_asin":"B09X1GM8FT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-926084","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X1GM8FT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X1GM8FT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
