window.products.push({"id":926220,"name":"143 pcs Cake Decorating Set, Hightingale Professional Cake Decorating Kit Baking Supplies with Weight Scale, Turntable Stand, Icing Spatula, Russian N","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qheJ0xJFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🛒<b>COMPLETE CAKE DECORATING & BAKING SUPPLIES:</b> All are included in one set and you do not need to buy other things. ✔Electronic Scale ✔1 Cake Stand ✔48 Numbered Icing tips ✔6 Korean Bobbi Skirt Icing Tips ✔2 Icing Spatula ✔5 Measuring Spoons ✔3 Cake Scrapers ✔A Whisk✔2 Silicon Pastry Bag ✔31 Disposable Icing bags ✔Flower Lifter & Nail✔1 Cleaning brush ✔6 Muffin Cups✔ 1 Cake Fondant Smoother 🛒<b>AN ELECTRONIC SCALE: </b>They are well made, and they measure accurately. It can save space and is nice and compact & light, takes up little room. Display is digital and clear. Easy to use, just pop the bowl or container onto the scales then press the on button. You can choose between which units you prefer to measure in metric or imperial. 🛒<b>SMOOTH REVOLVING TURNTABLE : </b>This cake turntable stand revolves smoothly with hidden ball bearings. It can help you decorate cakes for birthdays, weddings and other important events easily. It can revolve clock & anti clock wise, is good for both Right & Left handers. Use straight spatula for icing round cakes from sides and angled spatula from Top while rotating turntable. Turntable is made from non-stick & dishwasher safe plastic. 🛒 <b>EASY TO USE AND CLEAN: </b> All the numbered tips can make different flower shape, and they are easy to use. 14 pcs fondant molds that can create various patterns on cakes, which can be flexibly combined and directly carved on the surface of the cake. In addition, a cleaning brush is included to make it easier for you to clean the tips. 🛒 <b>SUITABLE FOR PROFESSIONALS AND BEGINNERS:</b> Easy to use and operate. It has a wide range of uses such as home cooking, bakery, party, dining, wedding, celebration, pastry, etc. It is also a good gift for Christmas, Easter, Mother's Day and Birthday. Make a wonderful cake decoration set for your soul mate, your parents or friends! If you have any questions, please contact us without hesitation!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qheJ0xJFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hightingale","source_asin":"B089F8XW7Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-926220","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089F8XW7Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089F8XW7Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
