window.products.push({"id":926314,"name":"Durobor Norwegian Highball Glasses, Set of 6, Clear Heavy Base Short Bar Glass - Drinking Glasses for Water, Juice, Beer, Wine, Whiskey, and Cocktails","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Y0dg70UsL._AC_.jpg","description":"This set of six Norwegian Glasses will serve all your drinkware needs, from hosting dinners to offering a cup of cold water: Made in Belgium These luxurious glasses were made near Belgium by Durobor; the mecca of glassware, where incredibly talented glassmakers have made it their life's work to produce exceptional drinkware that not only looks beautiful but stands the test of time. Contemporary Design These glasses dawn a contemporary look that is perfect for entertaining and everyday use. With their triangular silhouette and clean design, this set is versatile enough for casual and formal use; great for serving water with dinner or creating unique cocktails at a dinner party. No carvings and patterns complete the look for a classical glass that can be used anytime. Lightweight, yet Sturdy Glass These lightweight glasses are made of fine grade sands and finished in premium glazes that result in a drinking glass that's sturdier than the competition and strong enough to be used time and time again. Its heavy base helps prevent the glass from shattering when muddling. Shaped for a Comfortable Grip The highball glasses' thin shape is easy to grasp, while their lightweight construction allows one to hold the glass for extended periods of time without tiring the hands or wrists. Each glass is perfect for hands of all sizes and are especially convenient for arthritic hands! Lead-Free Glass Feel safe serving beverages to loved ones in this guaranteed lead-free drinkware set. No worries about harmful chemicals and substances leaching into your drinks here! Easy to Clean These drinking glasses are extremely easy to clean. Just wash each glass by hand with soap and warm water to let the residue beverage slide off or safely place them in the dishwasher to  get them sparkling clean!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Y0dg70UsL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Durobor","source_asin":"B07FPHCQM9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-926314","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FPHCQM9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FPHCQM9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
