window.products.push({"id":926318,"name":"Silicone Pot Holders Trivets Mats, Multipurpose Non-Slip Insulation Honeycomb Rubber Plate Holder, Heat Resistant Antislip Hot Pads Trivet, 5 Pack (Li","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bL9hmURbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✨【FOOD-GRADE SILICONE】-- Wonlex trivets are made of food-grade raw materials of silica gel so it has strong flexibility. They can be bent, twisted, pinched, traced, stretched, and they can be touched food directly. The silicone material protects the tabletop surface and keeps it from water, oil, or press resistance, meanwhile, the mat can reduce noise from plates and bowls. ✨【HONEYCOMB DESIGN】-- The unique honeycomb design can decrease weight and distributes heat evenly to better protect your hands. The honeycomb pattern is anti-sliding and heat resistant. It has a large scope of heat-resistant, which at -40F to 446F to fit the oven, microwave, and dishwasher environment. ✨【EASY TO STORE & DURABLE】-- There is a hole designed for easy cleaning and quick dyirng by hanging it on sticky hooks, thus there will be less breeding of bacteria and make it cleaner. Our potholder sets provide long-lasting durability and better protection for your countertops while maintaining their flexibility. ✨【MULTI-PURPOSE KITCHEN TOOLS】-- Diameter: 7 inches. Our mats are thinner(0.1in/pcs) than traditional sets to convenient customers to fold and grip something. It can be used as a waterproof mat, pot holder, heat insulation mat, placemat, teapot mat, spoon rest, and so on. Besides, you can use it to grip hot pans or soup pots and open bottle caps. ✨【MACHINE WASHABLE】-- The trivets are easy to clean, you can wash them by hand or throw them in the dishwasher. They can also be boiled and disinfected in hot water. NOTE: Do NOT use the steel brush to avoid scratches and damage to the silicone. There are 5 trivets in 1 set. If you have any problem, please feel free to contact us and we will try our best to solve it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bL9hmURbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"wonlex","source_asin":"B07GCFR2DC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-926318","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GCFR2DC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GCFR2DC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":926319,"name":"Trademark Fine Art Lake Maix by Philippe Sainte-Laudy Gallery-Wrapped Art, 5-Panel Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":153.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+8eVk65nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art set piece features a landscape composition with a reflection in a lake. Photographer by passion for years, Philippe took an immediate liking to photographing landscape and nature. Always in search of the best light and the most original angle, he maintains a constant search for the most beautiful places surrounding him. Philippe prides himself in understanding the complex interactions between light, weather, landscape, the tides, plants and animals. He finds it is important to have a deep respect for this planet and its inhabitants. Philippe hopes that his photography can bring people closer to nature and encourage them to preserve it for future generations. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+8eVk65nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00LDVBWBQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-926319","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LDVBWBQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LDVBWBQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
