window.products.push({"id":926382,"name":"Folding Desk TV Tray Table with 6 Height and 3 Tilt Angles, Stable Adjustable TV Side Tables with Cup Holder, Portable Table Trays for Office, Living ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HIs-O+VOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【6 Height & 3 Angles Adjustable Side Table】: This tray table can easily adjust 6 height and 3 angles to meet your need. You can adjust the height up and down by pressing the silver buttons on both sides from 20.4”-28”. Top of the TV tray table has 3 angles, horizontal, 30°upwards and 30°downwards, which can perfect meet your various needs like eating or working. 【L Shape Table Corner TV Tray】: To advance the frame of the TV tray table, we add a cross bar between two legs at the bottom, preventing the possible shake or slide. We changed the original arc-shaped corners to L-shaped corners to avoid table dump forward, enhancing the stability of the sofa side table. 【Suit for any Situation】: Because of the simple and practical structure of this tray table, it can be used in plenty of places. This portable table trays can use as a TV dinner tray, a sofa side table, and it also can place at the edge of your bed to become a movable workstation, a snack tray and so on. 【Easy to Store & Clean】: Feature as its collapsible attributes, this folding tray tables can easily folded and store under the sofa and bed. Surface of the portable TV table is easy to clean, because the material of the top is smooth and not easy to leave stains. 【Easy Assembly &24 H Customer Service】: You don’t need tools to assemble this TV tray and it may will only take you less than 5 minutes. We provide 24 hours customer service to help you with any questions or concerns you may have. Enjoy your comfortable life with the lightweight but practical TV tray together!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HIs-O+VOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Catrimown","source_asin":"B094HTTZ74","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-926382","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094HTTZ74","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094HTTZ74","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
