window.products.push({"id":926411,"name":"Water Tea Electric Kettle SR968B, SunRose 1.7L Stainless Steel 100% BPA Free 1500W Quick Boiling Water Kettle for Coffee and Tea, Cordless with Auto S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Ilqt4j2rL._AC_.jpg","description":"The SunRose 1.7L Stainless Steel Electric Kettle makes it easy to enjoy tea, coffee, milk, instant noodles, and baby food within a few minutes. It's your perfect electric kettle for everyday life. Features● Stainless Steel material, 100% BPA free to provide healthy water for your family.● 1.7L large capacity 1500W kettle can quickly boil water within 4-7 mins, effectively shortening waiting time.● Automatic Shut-Off and Boil-Dry protection to ensure user safety, energy-saving and durability.● The water level window makes checking water levels easier in the kettle.● 360° rotational base, cordless design easy for filling and serving. Specifications1. Color: Black2. Material: Stainless Steel, BPA-Free Plastic3. Capacity: 1.7L4. Operating Power: 1500W5. Voltage: 120V6. Dimensions: 9.84 x 7.40 x 11.33 inches7. Weight: 2.53LB8. Boiling Time: 4~7 mins Package1 x SunRose Electric Kettle1 x 360 degrees cordless base1 x User Manual Guaranteed and ServiceSunRose Stainless Steel Electric Kettle provides 1 years warranty and 7*24hrs services. If any questions, please feel free to contact us. How to Descale?① Vinegar to removed scale: you can try to fill a pot with salty water and vinegar before going to bed at night. Till the next morning, brush it with detergent, and the scale will easily fall off.② Lemon to removed scale: cut up one whole lemon, add the lemon and 500ml water to the kettle, boil, let stand for one hour until the water is cooled, then take a soft cloth or sponge to wipe down the inside. Pour out the water and rinse the kettle a few times until any taste of lemon is gone.③ You can also replace the baking soda, boiled eggs or eggshells.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Ilqt4j2rL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09X1KP2ZB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-926411","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X1KP2ZB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X1KP2ZB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
