window.products.push({"id":926459,"name":"abcGoodefg Automatic Soap Dispensers Touchless Hands Free Soap Dispenser Pump 300ML IPX6 Waterproof Foam Sensor Hand Sanitizer Dispenser (Light Wood G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TMFuEe61L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Specification: Material: ABS Capacity: 300ml Package content: 1x Smart foaming Soap Dispenser (Not Battery Included) 1x User Manual Operation Instructions: 1. Please rotate the cover on the bottom of the dish auto soap dispenser. Insert 4 AAA 1.5V batteries and then close the cover. 2. Press the button on the bottom. You will see the light is flashing. Now the device is normal working. 3. Open upper case on the body to add the liquid. 4. For the first time you use, please try a few times first. Then the liquid will fill the hose and then will come out. 5. The distance between your hands to the sensor is around 5CM (1.97 inches). Each time it will pump out around 1ML liquid. If you need more liquid, please hold on your hand and wait for around 2 seconds. Then more liquid will come out soon. Important Note: 1. 4xAAA battery is required for the infrared soap dispenser. When installing, please check \"+\" and \"-\" symbols of battery and soap dispenser to install correctly 2. If the soap dispenser cannot dispense the soap properly, please poke the nozzle of the soap dispenser by hand, so that the internal straw can contact with the air to dispense the soap Cautions: 1. When the liquid level is low, please add liquid. Otherwise the soap dispenser will not pump out any liquid. 2. When light is flashing, it means battery low. Please change the batteries. 3. Please do NOT shake the devices to avoid any serious damage. 4. Please take out the battery if long time no use. 5. If your liquid is too thick, you need to dilute it with water. 6. Normal working temperature is 3℃-40℃","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TMFuEe61L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"abcGoodefg","source_asin":"B08D75MPX5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-926459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D75MPX5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D75MPX5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
