window.products.push({"id":926464,"name":"Christmas Tree Topper Lighted Snowflake Tree Topper with LED Projector, White Snowflake and Star Rotating Lights, 3D Glitter Silver Snow Tree Topper f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qKCKWCcWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Lighted Xmas star tree topper: Snowflakes tree topper features Hollow 3D Star design with LED projector lamp inside. The frame of the snowflake is covered with silver bling glitter, adding sparkling light to your Christmas tree decorations, Let you and your friends enjoy a special Christmas party. Excellent Snowflake Projection Effect: The built-in magic LED rotating projector can project the dynamic pattern of high-definition snowflakes and stars. You can adjust the direction of the projection light to your needs, creating incredibly realistic virtual snow on the ceiling of your home. Magic Snowflake Projector Light: The built-in white rotating snowflake and star projection light not only can keep directional movement regularly, but also you can adjust the distance and direction of the LED projection to project a different gorgeous effect. Recommend Distance:The farther from the ceiling,the larger of the projection range.Distance to ceiling: 3FT, projection range: 2*3FT,Distance to ceiling: 4FT, projection range:3*4FT. Easy to Decorate for Christmas Tree : Just install the base of the star topper on the top of the Christmas tree and adjust to the right angle.Then plug in the power switch,the tree star topper projector decoration will emit a beautiful snowflake and star light. The five-pointed star topper covered in a fine gold glitter to shine atop your Christmas tree, that catches and reflects the light in the room. Perfect Christmas Decoration Gift: Snowflake tree toppe will perfectly embellish your Christmas tree, suitable for Christmas, holiday party, family dance, shopping mall decoration and other occasions, to create a unique chriatmas atmosphere for your home. Comes with a beautiful gift box,would be a great Christmas decor gift for family kids friends and colleagues.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qKCKWCcWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LSXD","source_asin":"B08H85MGVN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-926464","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H85MGVN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H85MGVN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
