window.products.push({"id":926478,"name":"BORPRES Cooling Pillowcase,Japanese Chill-Plus Tech,Q-MAX>0.43 Cooling Fiber, Absorbs Heat Keep Cool,Double Sided Design,Idea for Hot Sleeper Night Sw","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eVcXV0bZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What You Need: Tired of not being able to enjoy a proper night sleep because of night sweats and general discomfort? The BORPRES pillowcase is the perfect choice for every light sleeper! Premium Quality Fabrics: This pillowcase is made with superior quality, highly durable extra soft fabrics, a combination of 90% micanylon and 10% PE cool fabric on the front side and 100% soft elastic knitted fabric on the back, being easy to wash and guaranteed to withstand the test of time! Choose Your Size: Our pillowcase is available in three different sizes, suitable for your individual needs. Choose from Queen 18”x27”, King 18” x32”. Comfort is Key: This lightweight pillowcase has a highly breathable, soft texture, being gentle on sensitive skin. The frontal cool fabric is perfect for night sweaters, having excellent permeability and taking away moisture without absorbing your sweat. Hidden Zipper Design - Want to look more stylish and beautiful? Our cooling pillowcases feature a hidden zipper design that you won't notice the zipper, but it allows the pillow to be securely hidden in the pillowcase and it is easy to put on and take off. Bringing you a beautiful look while making your body and mind more comfortable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eVcXV0bZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BORPRES","source_asin":"B095CB3B6C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-926478","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095CB3B6C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095CB3B6C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":926479,"name":"Wine Making Equipment Kit with Merlot Ingredient Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MsPJ93REL._AC_SL1194_.jpg","description":"Making 6 gallons of top quality Merlot is easy with this Wine Making Equipment and Ingredient Kit. Merlot has a full, fruity intensity, deep in color with black cherry and berry aromas. Wine making is a hot hobby right now, as people are realizing the outstanding quality of wine you can make at home at a fraction of the cost of buying it commercially. You just cant go wrong with the quality of WineExpert Ingredient Kits. They take all the guesswork out of making the highest quality wines time after time. No acids to test and balance, no sugars to add, no pH to worry about, it is all taken care of for you in the latest, state of the art facilities, leaving you to quite literally just add water. This is the fun and easy way to make great wine you will be proud to serve to your friends and family. The versatile equipment kit accommodates the winemaker using fresh fruit, grape juices and concentrates as well as those using winemaking kits. It comes with an easy to use double lever corker that requires less physical strength than a hand or plunger style corker. The kit is easily expandable as you become more advanced, nothing is wasted. The Equipment Kit includes: 7.9 gallon Plastic Wide Mouth Fermenter with a Lid; 6 gallon Better Bottle Plastic Carboy with Stopper; Airlock; Hydrometer; Racking Tube with anti-sediment tip; 5 ft Flexible Tubing; Bottle Filler; Carboy and Bottle Washer with a faucet adapter; Easy Double Lever Corker; 30 Wine Corks; Starter Booklet; and Sanitizer. The Ingredient Kit includes: 10 Liters pure varietal juice and juice concentrate, Wine Yeast, Clarifier, Stabilizer, Oak (when appropriate) and detailed instructions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MsPJ93REL._AC_SL1194_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Home Brewery","source_asin":"B0006UFY78","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-926479","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0006UFY78","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0006UFY78","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
