window.products.push({"id":926481,"name":"Riverbay Furniture Farmhouse Wood Set of Two Side Chairs in Navy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rIC5QGHAL._AC_.jpg","description":"The traditional silhouette of this farmhouse side chair is coated in a dazzling navy blue, providing a gust of coastal sentiment. Made of ash wood for ensured strength and stability, the frame is painted, sealed and sanded down before being covered in a glossy lacquer finish. This method provides resistance to liquid, chipping and flaking for years to come. A high slatted back offers ample support and makes for a lovely accent piece in modern cottage dining spaces. The set of two arrives fully assembled and supports up to 300 lbs each seat.Features :- Crafted from Ash Lumber- Navy Painted Finish- Solid ash wood construction provides stability and durability- Navy blue paint contrasts beautifully against a variety of lighter decor- Lacquer coating provides protection against wear and tear and is a breeze to clean- 18\" seat height perfectly matches tables 28\" to 30\" high- High slat back design pays homage to traditional farmhouse design- Arrives Fully Assembled- Arrives in a set of two.Specifications :- Assembly Required : Fully Assembled- Product Dimensions : 18.50\"w x 20\"d x 39.25\"h- Product Weight : 20 lbs- Seat Height : 18\"- Seat Dimensions : 18.5\" x 16.38\"- Weight Capacity : 300 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rIC5QGHAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Riverbay Furniture","source_asin":"B09NQBZ5HS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-926481","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NQBZ5HS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NQBZ5HS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":926482,"name":"Brownlow Gifts Easel Book, Suzy Toronto We are Sisters One Wacky Heart","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yku0zManL._AC_.jpg","description":"This Suzy Toronto Easel Book is full of fabulous quotes, advice and observations that you can read at your own pace. Wire bound, the Easel Book stands upright and folds flat when not in use. In partnership with Brownlow, Suzy Toronto designs bring you wild and life affirming statements from a wonderful wacky woman. Brownlow Gifts began from a desire to create gifts that would last much longer than flowers and give hope and inspiration long after flowers are gone. Brownlow Gifts has grown into creating inspirational, fashion accessory, paper, and baby gifts along with a selection of gift able kitchen items. The Brownlow Gifts family business continues making products that inspire people and help them connect with the people they love.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yku0zManL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brownlow Gifts","source_asin":"B00INBLIQS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-926482","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00INBLIQS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00INBLIQS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
