window.products.push({"id":926732,"name":"GMISUN Amber Glass Soap Dispenser, 2 Pack Thick 16 Oz Hand and Dish Soap Dispenser Set with Matte Black Stainless Steel Pump, Vintage Antique Farmhous","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617YwwoC1AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【VINTAGE AMBER GLASS SOAP DISPENSER】 With the latest stylish round exterior and the beautiful amber color, GMISUN’s amber soap dispenser emits class and uniqueness. The hand and dish soap dispenser set would be the perfect antique decorations for your kitchen and bathroom. They will complement the other vintage, farmhouse, and rustic decors in your home and together they will showcase the aesthetic you are looking for. 【THICK & PREMIUM AMBER GLASS】 Why Choose Amber Glass Soap Dispenser? Amber brown colored glass provide wonderful ultraviolet protection for the dish and hand soap dispenser set. The glass soap dispenser also suitable for filling most soap such as hand soap, dish soap, liquid soap, lotion, lotion, conditioner, etc. Reusable liquid soap dispenser with sturdy thick amber glass would be the best eco-friendly alternative to pollutant plastic soap dispensers. 【RUSTPROOF STAINLESS STEEL PUMP】 The pump of GMISUN’s kitchen soap dispenser set is made of high-quality stainless steel, which would keep long-lasting beautiful bright. The delicate manufacturing technique not only ensures that the glass soap dispenser with pump will not leak in use, but also ensures that the soap pump dispenser is easy and comfortable to use. Press smoothly without being stuck. And you can get a proper amount of soap for each press rather than any spray messy. 【6PCS WATERPROOF ELEGANT LABELS】 GMISUN provides 6pcs elegant waterproof labels for each bathroom soap dispenser set. The highly effective waterproof feature makes them stay tightly attached to the soap and lotion dispenser set in the kitchen and bathroom without any wrinkling, warping, or breaking from moisture. Making your kitchen and bathroom tidy and clean and giving the hand soap and dish soap dispenser set a more vintage vibe. 【RISK-FREE PURCHASE & SUPERIOR QUALITY SERVICE】 GMISUN aims to provide the best product and service to every customer and make every customer have the best shopping experience. If you have any questions about the hand soap dish soap dispenser set, please feel free to contact us. We will reply to you ASAP and provide you with satisfactory solutions. SIMPLE LIFE, DIFFERENT LIFE.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617YwwoC1AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GM GMISUN","source_asin":"B09NY62VX5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-926732","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NY62VX5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NY62VX5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":926733,"name":"Dwellbee 19 Gallon Otto Laundry Hamper (22.5\" x 16” x 12, 22.5\" x 16\" x 12\", Natural Bamboo, Cream Trim","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91M-6wV7ktL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DWELLBEE • \\dwell•bee\\ At one point during our product development process, we asked ourselves one simple question: What makes a product great? It seemed silly that it had taken us so long to ask such a simple question. We had been tinkering around with materials and making various products for years before it dawned on us. After much thought and deliberation, we came up with a list of core elements that we found are the most important in achieving a top-tier product. These elements are QUALITY, INTENTION, SIMPLICITY, CONSISTENCY, and BEAUTY. Inspired and excited, we rethought every step of our design process and began making products that embodied our core elements. We didn’t want to add another uninspired product to the already congested marketplace. It boils down to one thing: We want products that inspire our customers as well as ourselves. There is no point in bringing another mediocre product into this world. MATERIALS, DIMENSIONS, and CAPACITY The Tres hamper is crafted out of bamboo, a rapidly renewable resource. Bamboo is a grass and grows 3-5 times faster than traditional timber. This makes it the perfect candidate for responsibly creating sustainable products. The Tres hamper is an ultra-compact 23.5” x 13.8” x 13.8” (60 cm x 35 cm x 35 cm) and holds an incredible 17 gallons. QUALITY GUARANTEE We believe in our products. Did you receive a damaged item? Don't worry, 99% of the time this damage occurs during shipping. Our quality guarantee covers all damage related to shipping and ensures the product to be free of defects and faulty craftsmanship. If for any reason the quality of your product doesn't meet your expectations, please contact us immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91M-6wV7ktL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dwellbee","source_asin":"B01N486EOV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-926733","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N486EOV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N486EOV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
