window.products.push({"id":926778,"name":"ROSMARUS Bed Pillows for Sleeping, 20 x 30 inches Queen Pillows 2 Pack, Luxury Cotton Hotel Pillows, Supportive Fluffy Down Alternative Pillow for Bac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91W5+I2tEbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUPPORTIVE & SOFT - ROSMARUS bed pillow achieves an ideal balance between softness, comfort, and stable support. The ergonomic design makes the pillow fit the curve of the head, providing gentle support and ultimate comfort to relieve neck and shoulder pressure, making you feel like sleeping in the clouds. Perfect for side、stomach、back sleepers, and any sleeping position. FLUFFY & COMFY - Our sleep pillow is filled with high-quality spiral 3D microfiber cotton padding, which is more breathable, softer, fluffier, and more supportive than ordinary 3D fiber. Excellent performance, high resilience, and no deformation. Effectively support the cervical spine, protect the neck, and help you get quality sleep. SKIN-FRIENDLY - The case of our luxury hotel pillows are made of 100% natural cotton, which is very soft, comfortable, skin-friendly, smooth, and breathable. No friction noise, no linting, help you enjoy a restful and healing sleep. LUXURY HOTEL PILLOW - Our down alternative pillow can withstand repeated use and frequent washing, durable for daily use. The gusseted side band design ensures that the pillow retains its shape and will not go flatten. Machine washable pillow, easy to maintain, non-shrink, no fading, no clumping. PILLOW COLLECTION - King pillow measures 20 x 36 inches. Our bed 2-pack pillows are vacuum sealed for shipment, and they will start to become fluffy once opened. Please allow 24 hours for the pillow to be completely fluffy before use. 100% customer satisfaction is guaranteed. Any questions, feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91W5+I2tEbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROSMARUS","source_asin":"B08VF2NJGG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-926778","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VF2NJGG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VF2NJGG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":926779,"name":"MR.CHOU Glass Mixing Bowl Set of 3 with BPA Free Airtight Lids, Nesting Bowls with Non-slip Silicone Bottom, Large Mixing Bowls for Food Storage, Dish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XZaJrQCFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Keep Your Bowl Stable】 If you need to mix ingredients vigorously, it’s important to have a mixing bowl that is slip-resistant. Each of MR.CHOU Mixing Bowl with a silicone bottom to keep the bowl from moving around on the countertop while mixing, kneading, or whipping food, so you can easily mix all your favorite ingredients. Also, our Glass Mixing Bowls with Lids set are more durable than others, thanks to their silicone non-slip bottom that acts as a cushion and reduces the risk of shattering. 【Leak-proof and Keep Fresh】 For many cooks, being able to store food in mixing bowls is an important purchasing factor. While you can always put a bit of aluminum foil or plastic wrap over the bowl, those are not as secure as a tight-fitting lid. MR CHOU Cooking Bowls come with BPA-free airtight lids, which means you’ve got a simple, mess-free way to keep your food fresh, especially if you’re a fan of leftovers. 【Make Cooking Easier】 No matter whether you're a beginner or advanced, mixing bowls are an indispensable kitchen essential. With different sizes of 2.2, 1.1, and 0.5 QT, you can complete all the kitchen workhorses from preparation, and mixing to storage effortlessly. MR.CHOU 3-Piece Glass Mixing Bowl Set is perfect for whipping up cakes, tossing salads, marinating, and storing. Plus, the mixing bowls are designed for microwave and dishwasher-safe, so you can easily reheat your food and clean the bowls. 【Healthier Options】 If your ingredients contain anything acidic, stay away from reactive bowls. Our Baking Bowls are made of thicker and stronger borosilicate glass which is non-reactive, so it will not chemically affect the color, taste, and texture of your food. In addition, the transparent glass means you can more easily know the status of the contents, and the smooth interior also helps prevent a batter or other mixtures from sticking, helping you maximize your use of food. 【Stackable for Space Saving】 Compared to other bowls, our Kitchen Bowl Sets have the advantage of space-saving. Salad bowls of different sizes can be nested seamlessly, keeping your kitchen clutter-free at all times. The bowl size also fits your standard-size refrigerator shelves and pantry. Besides, our Nesting Bowls are deeper than standard bowls, so you don't need to worry about splashing when whisking eggs. 【Your Purchase is 100% Risk Free】Whether you are hosting a huge holiday dinner or a small intimate dinner for two, you’ll need a dinner bowl set that is both durable and functional. If you’re searching for a set of mixing bowls that are designed to last, go with MR.CHOU glass mixing bowls. Customer satisfaction is our primary goal. If the product is damaged upon arrival, or you have any dissatisfaction or problems with our products, please contact us immediately, and we will reply within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XZaJrQCFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MR. CHOU","source_asin":"B0BS96988G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-926779","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS96988G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS96988G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":926780,"name":"KitchenRaku Silicone Baking Mat, Nonstick Pastry Mat for Rolling Out Dough, Nonslip Macaroons Baking Mat with Measurement Guide, Food-Grade Oven Mat f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vkIUx+nKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"0.7MM THICKENED SILICONE MAT: 0.7MM KitchenRaku silicone pastry Mat consists of multi-layers of silicone and fiberglass. This thickened silicone mat is nearly twice thicker than other silicone mats. When kneading, rolling, or shaping dough, it is more slip resistant and durable. This multi-layer material can keep the mat from wrinkling and fading. 100% PLATINUM FOOD GRADE SILICONE: The silicone rolling mat is made of top-quality platinum food grade silicone and reinforced fiberglass, it is BPA, PFOA, and PVC free. Unlike the ordinary baking mat, our silicone baking mat has been fully vulcanized, it will never change color or generate smell no matter how many hours you bake it! NON-STICK AND NON-SLIP: The non-slip surface keeps the pastry mat staying in place on countertops, and the helpful size guidelines on this mat will help you evenly distribute cookie dough or roll out pie dough easily! The excellent nonstick working surfaces don't need flour to prevent sticking, the dough will slide, turn and roll easily! It works for any food like cookies, pie dough, fondant, and many others! EASY TO CLEAN AND STORE: Your countertop will always be clean when you use a nonstick rolling mat for kneading dough. Nothing will stick to this mat and the clean-up is easy, this mat is made of durable food-grade silicone and is dishwasher safe, simply washing with warm soapy water and air drying will be enough. MULTI-PURPOSE BAKING MAT: The flexible, nonstick, and reusable silicone baking mat can be used as a pastry rolling mat, oven baking mat, countertop mat, table mat, and craft mat, this mat can resist temperatures ranging from -40℉(-40℃) to 450℉(232℃), which is also microwave and freezer safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vkIUx+nKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KITCHENRAKU KR","source_asin":"B0B3X2995J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-926780","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3X2995J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3X2995J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
