window.products.push({"id":926981,"name":"Dollox Car Headrest Pillow, Neck Support Pillow for Car Seat Soft Memory Foam Neck Rest Pillow Cushion for Neck Pain Relief Ergonomic Design Travel Pi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cK7MBDpYS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ergonomic Design: The car pillow designed with ergonomic curves, which can fill the gaps between car seat and neck effectively, it's perfect to support your neck and head, help you to relieve neck pain. Our car neck pillow providing comfortable experience for your shoulders, cervical and head, making you safer and more comfortable during journey. High Density Memory Foam: This car neck pillow is made of thick, high density memory foam, which can restored to its original shape after folding or pressing hard, and it will keep soft feel and comfortable. Breathable & Removable Cover: This headrest pillow uses breathable and soft cloth cover that won't hurt your skin. Equipped with zipper on the back, makes it easy and convenient to take the memory foam out then clean and wash the cover. Adjustable Strap: There is an elastic band and adjustable clips on the car seat neck pillow which can be firmly fixed on the seat, you can adjust the height of the headrest. It suitable for most car seat, game chairs or office chairs. Application: The headrest pillow is suitable for long travel driving, office crowds, PC game enthusiasts and others who always long time sitting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cK7MBDpYS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dollox","source_asin":"B095K8F61N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-926981","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095K8F61N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095K8F61N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":926982,"name":"Melange 12-Piece Melamine Dinnerware Set (Moroccan Tiles) | Shatter-Proof and Chip-Resistant Melamine Plates and Bowls | Red | Dinner Plate, Salad Pla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Q7uOzmK-L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"\"Experience the Difference of an Authentic Melamine Dinner Set Upgrade your dinnerware set with one that blends superior durability, hassle-free maintenance, and rustic charm. Made using heavy weight melamine, these dinner plate and bowls are virtually unbreakable, keeps chips and cracks at bay, and can actually be cleaned in the dishwasher. Introduce some quirk to your dinner table with a beautiful melamine dinnerware set that doesn’t cut corners. - Heavy duty feel and break-resistant design. - Comes in multiple pack options at a price you’ll love. - Assorted colors - Dishwasher safe and 100% BPA-free. - Great for camping, RVs and outdoor use. Extra Dose of Durability Not all melamine dinner sets are created equal. Most come with a melamine content of between 30-60% that makes them weak, prone to cracks, and easy to shatter. But we’ve taken the premium approach and used higher percentage of melamine to create dinner plates and bowls that beautifully weather the rigors of everyday use Great for Outdoors No need for paper plates. Whether you’re going out camping, having an outdoor soiree, or setting off in your RV or trailer, our melamine plates and bowls complement it all with a touch of durability. Tough and hardy, this dinnerware set introduces a sense of normalcy to outdoor dining without any of the fragility. Maintenance Made Easy Get yourself melamine plates and bowls that you can actually clean in the dishwasher. While others break or crack while placed in there, our fully melamine dinner set can be safely cleaned without chipping the plates or ruining the design. Dine in Style Quirky yet cute, vintage yet modern, this colorful melamine dinnerware infuses any setting with a charm that never quits. The plates and bowls come in multiple colors and design options and are crowned by beautiful asymmetry. About Mélange Mélange dinnerware is all about treating you to everyday elegance. We believe fine dinner sets shouldn’t mean fragile dinner sets. We believe every meal should be complemented by dinnerware that makes you smile. That’s why we’ve used premium materials to bring on the durability, special craftsmanship to enhance the longevity, and lovely detailing to catch anyone’s eye. \"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Q7uOzmK-L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B07GNRY49W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-926982","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GNRY49W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GNRY49W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
